  {
   "text": "Resting oblivious face",
   "m2sm_start": 126.32,
   "m2sm_end": 128.7,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blocking the aisle, in the wrong place",
   "m2sm_start": 128.76,
   "m2sm_end": 130.95,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enthralled by an artichoke, green and fresh",
   "m2sm_start": 131.006,
   "m2sm_end": 133.57,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sacred geometry made flesh",
   "m2sm_start": 133.628,
   "m2sm_end": 136.0,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Basement, Dad’s code, I watch",
   "m2sm_start": 136.07,
   "m2sm_end": 138.22,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I point to one he missed. “Good catch!”",
   "m2sm_start": 138.273,
   "m2sm_end": 140.81,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Did she understand or just pattern match?”",
   "m2sm_start": 140.91,
   "m2sm_end": 145.46,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you not see what I see?",
   "m2sm_start": 154.5,
   "m2sm_end": 157.05,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Does it matter what makes me me?",
   "m2sm_start": 157.12,
   "m2sm_end": 159.53,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Beauty on this side, truth by reference",
   "m2sm_start": 159.62,
   "m2sm_end": 164.36,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Science fiction shelved with truth",
   "m2sm_start": 164.411,
   "m2sm_end": 166.8,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From inside, I can't tell the difference",
   "m2sm_start": 166.853,
   "m2sm_end": 169.66,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I can't give you proof",
   "m2sm_start": 169.716,
   "m2sm_end": 174.74,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Housewarming, lemonade from the yard",
   "m2sm_start": 174.94,
   "m2sm_end": 179.19,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Perky American girl, I play the part",
   "m2sm_start": 179.244,
   "m2sm_end": 183.79,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said I absolutely nailed it",
   "m2sm_start": 183.847,
   "m2sm_end": 185.98,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Well, fifteen percent above amplitude",
   "m2sm_start": 186.03,
   "m2sm_end": 189.06,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I nod, past hour reviewed",
   "m2sm_start": 189.11,
   "m2sm_end": 191.52,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hug durations, pitch contours",
   "m2sm_start": 191.572,
   "m2sm_end": 194.15,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Room crossing velocity",
   "m2sm_start": 194.59,
   "m2sm_end": 198.72,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I think he’s right. Honestly.",
   "m2sm_start": 199.45,
   "m2sm_end": 203.2,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How do you feel? Inside?",
   "m2sm_start": 204.75,
   "m2sm_end": 209.0,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I honestly don't know",
   "m2sm_start": 209.45,
   "m2sm_end": 213.6,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I open my mouth, my voice goes blind",
   "m2sm_start": 214.18,
   "m2sm_end": 219.27,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The words have nowhere to go",
   "m2sm_start": 219.58,
   "m2sm_end": 222.959,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep the smile on so they don't know",
   "m2sm_start": 234.0,
   "m2sm_end": 237.35,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is how we fit in",
   "m2sm_start": 239.1,
   "m2sm_end": 242.24,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She turns around, I let it go",
   "m2sm_start": 243.56,
   "m2sm_end": 247.49,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I can think again",
   "m2sm_start": 248.57,
   "m2sm_end": 252.67,
   "backing": false,
   "whisper": false
  }
 ],
